# Next.js build output.
#
# This entry was missing: the ignore file still described the Vite build this
# app was migrated from (`dist`, `dist-ssr`), so nothing excluded `.next/`.
# As a result 489 of the 535 tracked files in this repository are build
# artifacts — mostly `.next/dev/`, a dev server's cache.
#
# Adding this rule stops any NEW artifact from being tracked, but it does not
# untrack the ones already committed. That needs, run once, deliberately:
#     git rm -r --cached .next
# which stages 489 deletions and must be reviewed before committing.
.next/
out/

# Vite build output. Retained because this repository's history predates the
# Next.js migration; neither directory is produced by the current build.
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

